<title>MALAYSIA: TABLE-Southern Bank year net up 36 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Southern Bank year net up 36 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  71.15   vs	  52.19</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 22.3    vs	  16.3</p>
<p>    Turnover		   216.62   vs	 185.12</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   110.01   vs	  82.79</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  4.24   vs  less   2.90</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's Southern Bank Bhd provides commercial banking and other financial services.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
